WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:05.575
An explicit service contract allows teams to build
clients and servers in parallel.

00:00:05.575 --> 00:00:11.218
Mocks help early work, and real integration tests
check the assumptions they encode.

00:00:11.218 --> 00:00:15.315
A shared API can support web, mobile and desktop
experiences.

00:00:15.315 --> 00:00:21.696
Compare server rendering and SPAs as presentation
choices, while keeping backend validation and

00:00:21.696 --> 00:00:23.443
access control consistent.
